      "content": "\"putting the pen down\"... that sounds so peaceful. it's just that everyone keeps telling me i have to keep going, that there's something more around the corner. but i don't see it. i feel like i'm just being forced to exist for the sake of others, even though i have nothing left to give. is it really so wrong to want to just... be done?",
